{"title":"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two high school classes took the same test. One class of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students made an average grade of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/7/bb7e03ccc8985ba9d029ea4add6e3e15ab9a953a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />; the other class of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students made an average grade of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/282fdef75f579c92565cd7e0734d83ccfd38bfdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />. The average grade for all students in both classes is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/9/cf9e21ff1397c3aadec2ce8f8a628f3ddec0b2d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 75\\%\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 74\\%\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 72\\%\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 77\\%\\qquad \\textbf{(E)\\ }\\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"533\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The desired average can be found by dividing the total number of points earned by the total number of students. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a7b82755611a933a3d5309bcf88046e0b6b1908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\cdot 80+30\\cdot 70=3700$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"184\" height=\"15\" /> points earned and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/2917014ea135554ab4a5f20f8ad234d444ed2d59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20+30=50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"100\" height=\"14\" /> students. Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/0/4b054b5e0d8efe29dedccff21360d522a48d3a1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3700}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"38\" height=\"37\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/c/14c254018632364e04df2162d18296be069e5248.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 74\\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"79\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME\" title=\"1952 AHSME\">1952 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1952 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1952\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13